flowchart LR
    ADM[Admin console] --> GW[API gateway<br/>auth, rate limit]
    GW --> PA[Promo API<br/>POST create, PUT status,<br/>GET by id and list]
    PA --> PDB[(Promo DB<br/>primary plus replicas,<br/>version column)]
    PDB -->|CDC| K[Kafka promo-changed]
    K --> PC[Promo cache projector] --> RC[(Redis<br/>active promos by market)]
    BKG[Booking and pricing services] --> EV[Promo evaluation service<br/>stateless, horizontally scaled]
    EV --> RC
    EV --> RED[(Redemption counters<br/>atomic decrement with budget)]
    EV -->|redemption events| K
